title: Remove deprecated cumulus-pallet-dmp-queue
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    ## Summary

    - Remove the `cumulus-pallet-dmp-queue` crate (deprecated after November 2024).
    - Drop workspace membership and umbrella feature/dependency wiring.
    - No in-repo runtime still depends on this pallet; DMP is handled via `pallet-message-queue`.

    Part of #11561
crates:
- name: polkadot-sdk
  bump: major
